WEBVTT - ConnectFour Connect 3-Minute Demo Video Subtitles (AILT9019 Group 31)

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.800
<v Yuzhou Zhou>[Yuzhou Zhou] Hello everyone! I'm Yuzhou Zhou, team lead for Group 31.</v>

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.500
<v Yuzhou Zhou>[Yuzhou Zhou] Modern university students experience substantial conversational anxiety on mainstream social platforms.</v>

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:23.500
<v Yuzhou Zhou>[Yuzhou Zhou] Appearance-driven swiping and unguided direct messaging create fear of superficial judgment and conversational paralysis.</v>

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
<v Yuzhou Zhou>[Yuzhou Zhou] With ConnectFour Connect, we introduce an activity-mediated social paradigm: interpersonal interaction is centered around turn-based Connect Four.</v>

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:37.500
<v Yuzhou Zhou>[Yuzhou Zhou] Game moves provide organic conversational pacing and dramatically lower emotional friction.</v>

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:44.500
<v Yuzhou Zhou>[Yuzhou Zhou] Guest onboarding is lightweight and collects zero persistent PII—players simply enter a nickname and birth year.</v>

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.500
<v Yuexiang Ma>[Yuexiang Ma] Hi, I'm Yuexiang Ma, backend systems and QA lead.</v>

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:59.200
<v Yuexiang Ma>[Yuexiang Ma] I designed our in-memory FIFO matchmaking queue and room lifecycle manager.</v>

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:07.000
<v Yuexiang Ma>[Yuexiang Ma] Our queue enforces an age filter where only peers with an age gap within three years are paired together, while rejecting registrations under eighteen.</v>

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:15.800
<v Yuexiang Ma>[Yuexiang Ma] To eliminate waiting times, if no compatible peer matches within our fifteen-second timeout, the engine automatically spins up a PvE room with our AI Coach.</v>

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:22.800
<v Yuexiang Ma>[Yuexiang Ma] In PvP matches, free-form text is structurally blocked by architectural design.</v>

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.800
<v Yuexiang Ma>[Yuexiang Ma] Players communicate exclusively through sportsmanlike canned phrases and Daily Icebreakers, completely eliminating peer harassment.</v>

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:36.500
<v Leo Shang>[Leo Shang] Hello, I'm Leo Shang, frontend client lead.</v>

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:44.500
<v Leo Shang>[Leo Shang] I developed the HTML5 Canvas 2D game board and client interaction layer.</v>

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:52.500
<v Leo Shang>[Leo Shang] We use a unified Pointer Events architecture that seamlessly normalizes multi-touch, stylus, and desktop mouse clicks with responsive coordinate scaling.</v>

00:01:52.800 --> 00:02:00.500
<v Leo Shang>[Leo Shang] Notice the smooth vertical gravity descent animation as tokens drop into the lowest vacant slot, and our glowing cyan indicator marking the most recent move.</v>

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:08.000
<v Leo Shang>[Leo Shang] Floating speech bubbles render real-time sportsmanship reactions with smooth CSS animations.</v>

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:14.800
<v Leo Shang>[Leo Shang] I also implemented procedural sound synthesis using the native Web Audio API—synthesizing token drops, victory arpeggios, and reaction pops with zero MP3 assets.</v>

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:22.000
<v Scott Xiang>[Scott Xiang] Hi everyone, I'm Scott Xiang, DevOps and deployment lead.</v>

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:30.500
<v Scott Xiang>[Scott Xiang] In PvE mode, we integrated Alibaba Cloud Bailian's Qwen3.6-Flash through an OpenAI-compatible endpoint.</v>

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:37.800
<v Scott Xiang>[Scott Xiang] The AI Coach acts as an engaging campus peer while enforcing strict conversational safety guardrails.</v>

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:46.000
<v Scott Xiang>[Scott Xiang] If the upstream API times out past 3.5 seconds or encounters rate limits, our local depth-4 Minimax algorithm immediately calculates the move in under 24 milliseconds.</v>

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:53.500
<v Scott Xiang>[Scott Xiang] On the infrastructure side, the platform runs in a hardened non-root container with read-only filesystems.</v>

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:59.500
<v Scott Xiang>[Scott Xiang] ConnectFour Connect delivers a safe, zero-latency, anxiety-free social gaming experience. Thank you!</v>
